$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add Checking --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add leumi --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 1000 --date 2026-10-01
Added account leumi (ILS).

$ moolah account add Leumi --kind bank --currency ILS
error: Leumi is already the name of an account in bank. Names must be unique, so choose another name
[exit 1]

$ moolah account add cash --kind cash --currency ILS
error: cash is already the name of a kind of account. Names must be unique, so choose another name
[exit 1]

$ moolah account add savings --currency ILS
error: give the kind of account with --kind: bank, cash, investment, pension, card, loan. To add a kind: moolah account kind add
[exit 1]

$ moolah account add savings --kind bnak --currency ILS
error: unknown kind "bnak". The kinds are: bank, cash, investment, pension, card, loan. To add a kind: moolah account kind add bnak --asset (or --liability)
[exit 1]

$ moolah account add savings --kind bank
error: give the account's currency, for example --currency USD. It cannot change later
[exit 1]

$ moolah account add savings    # answers: bank | 
Added account savings (ILS).
Kind of account (bank, cash, investment, pension, card, loan): Currency (cannot change later) [ILS]: 
$ moolah account kind add crypto --asset
Added kind crypto. Add accounts to it with: moolah account add <name> --kind crypto --currency <code>

$ moolah account add wallet --kind crypto --currency USD
Added account wallet (USD).

$ moolah account kind remove crypto
error: kind crypto still has accounts (wallet). Merge them into other accounts first
[exit 1]

$ moolah account kind rename crypto digital
Renamed kind crypto to digital.

$ moolah account kind list
Kind        Type       Accounts
bank        asset             2
cash        asset             0
digital     asset             1
investment  asset             0
pension     asset             0
card        liability         0
loan        liability         0

$ moolah category add restuarants --in food
Added category restuarants.

$ moolah category add nosuch:child
error: expenses:nosuch does not exist
[exit 1]

$ moolah category add Groceries
error: Groceries is already the name of a spending category in food. Names must be unique, so choose another name
[exit 1]

$ moolah add leumi -50 restuarants --date 2026-10-02
Added transaction 2 on 2026-10-02:
  leumi                          -50.00 ILS
  restuarants                    50.00 ILS

$ moolah category rename restuarants eating-out
Renamed restuarants to eating-out.

$ moolah register --category eating-out
ID  Date        Payee  Other side     Amount    Balance
 2  2026-10-02         leumi       50.00 ILS  50.00 ILS

$ moolah category merge eating-out restaurants
Merged eating-out into restaurants (1 transaction line moved).

$ moolah register --category restaurants
ID  Date        Payee  Other side     Amount    Balance
 2  2026-10-02         leumi       50.00 ILS  50.00 ILS

$ moolah account rename leumi checking
Renamed leumi to checking.

$ moolah account close checking --date 2026-10-31
error: checking has a balance of 950.00 ILS on 2026-10-31; move it to another account first
[exit 1]

$ moolah add salary 100 food
error: salary is a category; this needs a real account (assets or liabilities)
[exit 1]

$ moolah category add bonus --in salary --income
Added income category bonus.

$ moolah account list
